53\" width=600 height=160 /></span><br><br><strong>Gold and Gear:</strong> Earn gold by defeating slimes, and use it to bolster your arsenal. Upgrade your axe for resource gathering, improve your speed, and expand your base to accommodate more towers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655130/extras/6cf84eb2e8f5a15681cf11bedbab45ee.avif?t=1709056653\" width=600 height=206 /></span>",
